    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"change\" though. it feels much more permanent than that. when your whole life is online, your digital footprint IS your life. everyone knows that version of me, and that person is dead. i'm just this hollow shell now, waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the fact that i don't actually matter anymore. it's like i'm just a leftover part of a person that's already been deleted.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
