    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't think there's a \"core\" left. everything that made me *me* was the impact i had, the community, the voice... all of that is gone. it's like being a character in a book that had all its pages ripped out. even if the paper is still there, the story is over. why does it even make sense to keep the paper if the story's dead?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
