      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a terrible ache when your sense of self felt so interwoven with external validation. When the narrative feels gone, the immediate question of why to continue is incredibly heavy. However, the \"paper\" is still physically there, which means there is still *you* to experience the next unwritten chapter, even if you can't see it yet. Perhaps the story needs to start in a completely different, quiet place to find a new meaning.",
